  "description": "PIYTUQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H64 Gd4 N4 O24,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.603-3.802 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.22-104.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C56H70Gd4N6O24. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
